content:
Yosef mmammarima no:
    Efraim abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Amihud babarima Elisama;
    Manase abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Pedahsur babarima Gamaliel;

Nkɔmhyɛ a Balaam de maaeɛ no nie:
  “Balak, sɔre na tie;
    Sipor babarima tie me.

na yei ne nkɔmhyɛ a ɔmaaeɛ:
  “Beor ba Balaam nkɔmhyɛ no nie;
    nkɔmhyɛ a ɛfiri ɔbarima a nʼani hunu adeɛ yie,

deɛ ɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm;
    deɛ ɔhunu anisoadeɛ a ɛfiri Otumfoɔ hɔ;
    na ɔda fam, a nʼani gu so:

Yei ne nkɔmhyɛ a Balaam de maeɛ:
  “Beor ba Balaam nkɔmhyɛ no nie;
    nkɔmhyɛ a ɛfiri ɔbarima a nʼani hunu adeɛ yie,

deɛ ɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm;
    deɛ ɔwɔ nyansa a ɛfiri Ɔsorosoroni no
  deɛ ɔhunu anisoadeɛ a ɛfiri Otumfoɔ hɔ;
    na ɔda fam, a nʼani gu so:

Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔyɛ Yakob babarima panin Ruben asefoɔ:
    Hanokfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Hanok;
    Palufoɔ abusua, wɔde too a wɔn tete agya Palu;
